PARSFILE
#FullDataName Generic VS Commands`Articulated Bus Steering`
#VehCode Articulated Bus Steering

#MiscYellow0
OPT_CS(1,1) 1
CS_MZ_ROD(1,1) 0.0006
CS_MZ_SHAFT(1,1) 0.0001
#ENDMYellow

*MODELCODE Articulated Bus Steering

#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#The OPT_CS(1,1) keyword sets the compliance steer option.  Setting the compliance steer option for the first axle on the first unit to 1 or 2 defines an asymmetric steering system.  If the compliance steer option is set to 1, the steer angle of the left wheel is a function of the output of the steering gear with the right wheel steered by the tie rod.
#
#The CS_MZ_ROD(1,1) keyword sets steer due to the compliance in the tie rod.  The CS_MZ_SHAFT(1,1) keyword sets steer due to compliance in the steering shaft.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

